      "content": "thanks. can we make it a bit more specific about the timing? like, can you add that the work will happen specifically between 8pm Friday and 6am Sunday so they know exactly when to expect the temp changes? also, can you add a line about how we're doing this to prevent any \"unexpected\" or \"sudden\" system failures later on?",
